pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bgContent"
elements:
  - elementId: pageLabel
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 35, 200, 20]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: |
        <p>CORE FEATURES</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: pageTitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 60, 900, 45]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      text: |
        <p>AI字段识别：让数据自己说话</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: titleUnderline
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 115, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBorder"}
  - elementId: accuracyNumber
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 150, 250, 80]
    content:
      style: "$bigNumber"
      fontSize: 64
      text: |
        <p>95%+</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: accuracyLabel
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 235, 250, 30]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      text: |
        <p>字段识别准确率</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: descBody
    elementType: text
    bounds: [350, 150, 870, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>AI自动识别上传表格中的字段含义，将"订单金额"映射为"营业收入"、"推广费用"映射为"广告费用"……</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">无需专业财务背景，系统自动完成字段建档，人工仅需<strong style="color: $accent;">一键确认</strong>。</p>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 290, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBorder"}
  - elementId: exampleTitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 315, 400, 35]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      fontSize: 22
      text: |
        <p>字段映射示例</p>
      wrap: false
  - elementId: exampleTable
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 360, 1160, 280]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      headers: ["原始字段", "系统识别", "业务类型", "置信度"]
      rows:
        - ["订单金额", "营业收入", "收入类", "95%"]
        - ["商品成本", "商品成本", "成本类", "98%"]
        - ["推广费用", "广告费用", "费用类", "92%"]
        - ["物流费用", "运费", "费用类", "90%"]
        - ["购买数量", "销售数量", "数量类", "94%"]
    tableStyle: default
  - elementId: bottomLine
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 680, 1160, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$cardBorder"}